# Rpc Manager

## Document type
Document type: [CONTRACT]

## Version
**Version:** 1.0.0 | **Status:** Canonical | **Last Updated:** 2026-07-29 | **Owner:** Runtime Team

## Purpose
Authoritative owner for rpc manager.

## Scope
